  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac, this detached, near-new home delivers the best of easy-care living without compromising on space or flexibility.\r\n\r\nWith trusted brick construction on the outside and a smart, contemporary feel within, it's a sophisticated, compact pad that makes every square metre count. Perfect for executive couples wanting more time to enjoy life, or lock-and-leave buyers keen to travel, sail or explore more of our beautiful country.\r\n\r\nThe north-facing, open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is light, bright and surprisingly generous, flowing out to outdoor space with just enough room to BBQ, entertain and potter in the garden, without becoming a slave to weekend maintenance.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the flexible layout opens up plenty of options. Currently configured with a bedroom, bathroom and large separate studio or multi-purpose space, you can make it work for the way you live. Create a spacious master suite, add an ensuite if desired, retain the generous studio or reconfigure the space to create a three-bedroom home.\r\n\r\nLocation adds another big tick. Mairangi Bay Village and the beach are just down the road, while Constellation Drive is close by for easy motorway connections north, south and west. Add nearby golf courses, reserves, walkways and sought-after school zones, and you have a seriously convenient North Shore base.\r\n\r\nFreehold, detached, low-maintenance and full of possibilities. Lock the door and head off, or settle in and enjoy a simpler way of living.\r\n\r\nSchool Zones include; Mairangi Bay Primary, Murray Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nTo access and view property files, please follow this link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/IHG3",
